OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1791473180
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABid to run new trains on West
OL,4,ACoast Mainline refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt rejected an application from
OL,7,FWrexham, Shropshire and Midlands
OL,8,FRailway (WSMR) for four daily Wrexham
OL,9,Fto London Euston return services, as
OL,10,Fwell as Lumo's proposal for up to four
OL,11,Freturn services between Rochdale and
OL,12,FEuston on weekdays and Saturdays, and
OL,13,Fthree on Sundays.
OL,15,FAvanti West Coast's plans for
OL,16,Fadditional services between Blackpool
OL,17,Fand Euston were also denied by the ORR.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
